-	  Say Y here to enable support for Himax hx83112b touchscreens.
+	  Say Y here to enable support for Himax hx83100a, hx83102e and
+	  hx83112b touchscreens. The hx83102e is attached over SPI, the
+	  others over I2C.
 
 	  If unsure, say N.
 
