From 8794e74dae8615545eba9fd0faedc84a8f82f5a2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Viktor Zaritskyi <viktorzarickiy@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:46:52 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] drm/panel: himax-hx83102: add BOE TV104WUM and DCS
 backlight

Add the BOE TV104WUM, a 1200x2000 10.4" panel (135x226 mm) found on the
Samsung Galaxy Tab S6 Lite (2022), with its init sequence and timings.

This panel carries no separate backlight controller: brightness is set
over DCS. Describe that in the panel descriptor (dcs_backlight_max,
dcs_backlight_default) and register a backlight device when a panel
declares it, rather than leaving the panel at whatever brightness the
bootloader happened to set.

Signed-off-by: Viktor Zaritskyi <viktorzarickiy@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-himax-hx83102.c | 152 +++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 151 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-himax-hx83102.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-himax-hx83102.c
index 3644a7544..26fd9225a 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-himax-hx83102.c
